    },
    {
      "text": "And every time we say \"Allah\", the name of God, we wipe out God knows how many sins,",
      "start": 3296.98,
      "end": 3561.62,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " And",
