          "end": 3588.56,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, we make up for all the past years where we missed the Salat",
      "start": 3588.72,
      "end": 3603.74,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
