          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But they are unappreciative of God. God gave them the eyes in advance without any requirements.",
      "start": 4051.95,
      "end": 4057.41,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
